+Security
+--------
+
+* :setting:`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY` now defaults to ``'same-origin'``. With
+  this enabled, :class:`~django.middleware.security.SecurityMiddleware` sets
+  the :ref:`Referrer-Policy <referrer-policy>` header to ``same-origin`` on all
+  responses that do not already have it.
+
+  If your application requires a different value for the ``Referrer-Policy``
+  header, or if you wish to disable sending this header altogether, set
+  :setting:`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY` to the desired value or ``None``.
+
